Package: PeerChat
Type: Package
Title: PeerChat: Peer to Peer messaging library
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2026-06-01
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mateusz", "Nizwantowski",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "mateusznizwantowski@gmail.com")
    )
Description: UDP peer-to-peer messaging library backed by a C networking
    core. Provides R bindings for creating sockets, discovering peers via a
    central synchronization server written in C, and exchanging messages directly between
    clients without relaying through the server. It leverages custom made data protocol.
